      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is pretty awkward as well. How about explicitly unmapping the buffers only on queue submit so that we don\u0027t need to make `GetScopedPendingCommandContext` faillable?",
      "revId": "71e1ed54660288c9d9ec95f4043a179ac31d4c5b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c628d5c5_5dc5988d",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d11/BufferD3D11.cpp",
