      "writtenOn": "2026-01-28T17:52:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e If Queue::Submit is never called then the buffer would be sitting around mapped indefinitely, right?\n\nSure, but that\u0027s fine? The memory usage doesn\u0027t really grow from that since the buffer is mapped anyway. When ReduceMemoryUsage is called we could also force flushing the pending commands (which would end up in D3D11 unmapping the buffers).\n\nIt\u0027s just very nice in every backend if we can avoid doing error management when getting the recording context or the equivalent, because that\u0027s done everywhere. That\u0027s why we prepare the *next* command buffer during the end of queue submit in D3D12/Metal/Vulkan.",
      "parentUuid": "da711447_86066a66",
      "revId": "71e1ed54660288c9d9ec95f4043a179ac31d4c5b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3f0f7cec_f3b507ee",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d11/BufferD3D11.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 605,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-28T18:31:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I’ve removed the ConsumedError logic from this function, which should resolve the concern about calling it from non-API code. It no longer tries to acquire the command context here. PTAL.\n\nWe could move buffers\u0027 unmaps to `Queue::Submit`. However, currently in D3D11 there are many places the buffers needs to be unmapped outside `Submit` including buffer\u0027s revision synchronizations, `WriteBuffer`, `CopyFromStagingToBuffer`, re-map buffers in `FinalizeMap`, etc. Hence I think it\u0027s better to do the unmaps automatically when `GetScopedPendingCommandContext` is called. I don\u0027t think returning error when getting the context is a problem. Most of callers of it should be failable, (returning `MaybeError`). There are only 2 places that are not failable originally in this CL:\n- `DestroyImpl`: Originally needs the context to unmap, but it\u0027s removed in the latest ps.\n- `ReduceMemoryUsage`: This could be changed to return MaybeError in future.",
      "parentUuid": "855eb834_09fd851c",
      "revId": "71e1ed54660288c9d9ec95f4043a179ac31d4c5b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4a98d617_69521988",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d11/BufferD3D11.cpp",
